<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/>
<title>Procedimento Operacional - Falha de Comunicação via Rádio</title>
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fortawesome/fontawesome-free@6.4.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', sans-serif;
            background: #f5f5f5;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .slide-container {
            width: 1280px;
            height: 720px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            background: #ffffff;
        }
        
        .header-bar {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 1280px;
            height: 8px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #063B6B 0%, #F47B20 100%);
        }
        
        .logo-area {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            left: 1040px;
            width: 200px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        
        .logo-icon {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            background: #063B6B;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-size: 20px;
        }
        
        .logo-text {
            color: #063B6B;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        .main-content {
            position: absolute;
            top: 80px;
            left: 60px;
            width: 1160px;
            height: 580px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        
        .title-section {
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        
        .main-title {
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #063B6B;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }
        
        .title-highlight {
            color: #F47B20;
        }
        
        .subtitle {
            font-size: 20px;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        
        .content-grid {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
            flex: 1;
        }
        
        .left-section {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 24px;
        }
        
        .info-card {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            border-left: 4px solid #F47B20;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100px;
        }
        
        .card-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #063B6B;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        
        .card-content {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        
        .right-section {
            width: 420px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .train-illustration {
            width: 400px;
            height: 220px;
            background: #f0f4f8;
            border-radius: 16px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: visible;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        
        .train-body {
            width: 320px;
            height: 90px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #063B6B 0%, #0B3D6E 100%);
            border-radius: 40px 40px 10px 10px;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        .train-window {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            left: 20px;
            width: 60px;
            height: 25px;
            background: #87CEEB;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border: 2px solid #F47B20;
        }
        
        .train-window:nth-child(2) {
            left: 90px;
        }
        
        .train-window:nth-child(3) {
            left: 160px;
        }
        
        .train-door {
            position: absolute;
            top: 20px;
            right: 30px;
            width: 40px;
            height: 55px;
            background: #F47B20;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        
        .train-wheels {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -15px;
            left: 45px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 80px;
        }
        
        .wheel {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            background: #333;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 3px solid #666;
        }
        
        .radio-icon {
            position: absolute;
            top: -15px;
            right: -15px;
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            background: #F47B20;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-size: 32px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            z-index: 10;
        }
        
        .status-indicator {
            margin-top: 30px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background: #fff3e0;
            border-radius: 25px;
            border: 2px solid #F47B20;
        }
        
        .status-dot {
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            background: #F47B20;
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: pulse 2s infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes pulse {
            0% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
            50% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(1.1); }
            100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
        }
        
        .status-text {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #063B6B;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        .footer-bar {
            position: absolute;
            top: 680px;
            left: 0;
            width: 1280px;
            height: 40px;
            background: #063B6B;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        
        .footer-text {
            color: white;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="slide-container">
<!-- Header Bar -->
<div class="header-bar"></div>
<!-- Logo Area -->
<div class="logo-area">
<div class="logo-icon">
<i class="fas fa-train"></i>
</div>
<div class="logo-text">Operações Ferroviárias</div>
</div>
<!-- Main Content -->
<div class="main-content">
<div class="title-section">
<div class="main-title">
<span class="title-highlight">PROCEDIMENTO OPERACIONAL</span><br/>
                    FALHA DE COMUNICAÇÃO VIA RÁDIO<br/>
                    EM OPERAÇÕES FERROVIÁRIAS
                </div>
<div class="subtitle">Procedimento Operacional • Circulação de trem metropolitano, locomotiva e veículo auxiliar</div>
</div>
<div class="content-grid">
<!-- Left Column with Info Cards -->
<div class="left-section">
<div class="info-card">
<div class="card-title">
<i class="fas fa-bullseye" style="color: #F47B20;"></i>
                            Objetivo
                        </div>
<div class="card-content">
                            Estabelecer procedimentos para circulação de trem metropolitano, locomotiva e veículo auxiliar em situações de falha de comunicação via rádio.
                        </div>
</div>
<div class="info-card">
<div class="card-title">
<i class="fas fa-expand" style="color: #F47B20;"></i>
                            Abrangência
                        </div>
<div class="card-content">
                            CCO, Tráfego, Manutenção e Estações
                        </div>
</div>
<div class="info-card">
<div class="card-title">
<i class="fas fa-file-alt" style="color: #F47B20;"></i>
                            Documentos de Referência
                        </div>
<div class="card-content">
                            RDS da SSO; documentos internos aplicáveis
                        </div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Right Column with Illustration -->
<div class="right-section">
<div class="train-illustration">
<div class="train-body">
<div class="train-window"></div>
<div class="train-window"></div>
<div class="train-window"></div>
<div class="train-door"></div>
<div class="train-wheels">
<div class="wheel"></div>
<div class="wheel"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="radio-icon">
<i class="fas fa-broadcast-tower"></i>
</div>
</div>
<div class="status-indicator">
<div class="status-dot"></div>
<div class="status-text">Falha de Comunicação Detectada</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Footer Bar -->
<div class="footer-bar">
<div class="footer-text">SEGURANÇA • COMUNICAÇÃO • CONFIANÇA • OPERAÇÃO</div>
</div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
